### Page 1 of 6 (scanned page: machine OCR, may contain errors)

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:
Mayor Marian Orr, and City Council
FROM:
TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:
February 6,2019
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #S-13-19 for a contract between the City of Cheyenne,
Engineering Department, and Reiman Corp., Cheyenne, Wyoming, for the
Christensen Road Overpass & Corridor project.
Two (2)bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.Bids were received from
Reiman Corp., Cheyenne, Wyoming ($10,557,155.01), and S & S Builders, LLC, Cheyenne,
Wyoming ($11,674,108.74).
The bids were reviewed by Amy Allen, Molly Bennett and Sam Berta, of the City of Cheyenne
Engineering Department. Their recommendation is to accept the low bid from Reiman Corp. of
Cheyenne Wyoming, in the amount of $10,557,155.01.The Engineer's Estimate for the project
was $13,264,828.90.
The bids were also reviewed by HDR Engineering, and their letter of concurrence for the award
of theproject to Reiman Corp.is attached.
Funding: Specific Purpose Sales Tax Funding(6th Penny)
```

